WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Keep the lesson open in one Chrome tab.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Open DHIS2 in another tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Move the pointer to the DHIS2 tab and right-click it.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose “Add Tab to New Split View.”

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Select the lesson tab to show both pages side by side.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.300
Drag the divider to adjust the space for each page.
